      "what_must_be_true": "The AI datacenter build-out keeps leading-edge foundry/logic and HBM/DRAM tool demand elevated through at least FY2028, GAA and advanced-packaging inflections convert from EPIC-center engagements into volume shipments, China stays near 25 percent of revenue without a new export-control shock, and the H1 inventory/capex build ships in H2 so cash conversion normalizes above $1.5bn per quarter."
